WEBVTT

00:02:27.680 --> 00:02:31.056
Start out by losing
the whole interrogation vibe.

00:02:31.080 --> 00:02:34.486
Rather, interviewers should
view themselves as hosts,

00:02:34.510 --> 00:02:36.776
be friendly and welcoming.

00:02:36.800 --> 00:02:38.886
Choose an environment that's conducive

00:02:38.910 --> 00:02:40.666
to putting a candidate at ease,

00:02:40.690 --> 00:02:44.176
like making your interview room
look like a living room.

00:02:44.200 --> 00:02:46.470
People are most confident
discussing things

00:02:46.494 --> 00:02:49.156
about which they are
knowledgeable and passionate.

00:02:49.180 --> 00:02:51.739
So we ask candidates
to fill out a short questionnaire

00:02:51.763 --> 00:02:52.946
about their hobbies,

00:02:52.970 --> 00:02:55.327
and we start out the interview
by discussing those

00:02:55.351 --> 00:02:58.041
so that candidates could bring forth
their verbal skills,

00:02:58.065 --> 00:02:59.726
strengths and personality.

00:02:59.750 --> 00:03:02.856
Assess skills in everyday life situations